=== explicit interpretation bound (sealed statement, retained from V1) ===
  The filesource A-device is an ideal source and imposes ZERO source
  impedance. This experiment can therefore test whether the unloaded-
  versus-loaded stage-1 waveforms are SUFFICIENT to change stage-2
  reversal behaviour under ideal-source drive, but it CANNOT reproduce
  or prove the actual direct-cascade source impedance. Interpretation is
  bounded to waveform sufficiency under ideal drive.

